OL,3,GNEWSAImproved children's services earn
OL,4,Anational role
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe turnaround of a council's
OL,7,Fpreviously struggling children's
OL,8,Fservices has continued after it was
OL,9,Fselected to be held up as an example
OL,10,Fnationally.
OL,12,FNorfolk County Council's children's
OL,13,Fservices were rated "inadequate" in
OL,14,F2013 and 2015, but were judged as
OL,15,F"outstanding" in all areas by regulator
OL,16,FOfsted earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
