OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAImproved children's services earn
OL,4,Anational role
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the authority's department has been
OL,7,Fadded to the national Children's Social
OL,8,FCare Improvement Team by the Department
OL,9,Ffor Education (DfE), which will see it
OL,10,Fpartnered with a local authority that
OL,11,Fneeds to improve.
OL,13,FWendy Atkinson, the authority's cabinet
OL,14,Fmember for children, hailed the work of
OL,15,F"dedicated and talented staff" and said
OL,16,Fthe selection was "great to see".
